{"title":"Logarithm Properties","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Here are some <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">Logarithm</a> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698c1c9cde3469a346091405ffbbcedf96609562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" /> properties!\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b921d0b1cc173f96765ee0f9dd4b4b43f111035a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a(xy) = \\log_a(x) + \\log_a(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"225\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af78c27708464ad01ac88c16cf13fcfb7618ad63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a(\\frac{x}{y})=log_ax-log_ay$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"191\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a0bbde90017adcbc1032f7cf09c6d724f4fbf39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\log_ax}=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04c6e9ec0c8e9a85785737a7bcbaf635b186d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1caf7d42ead266ed858da55bbb420a20569153e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_aa=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>6. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5aa2bce691cb919611fc4cfc251d99a1409c34e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a\\frac{1}{a}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>7. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/4/0c4c1e28085b57d1588be70af3ad17829f6d8831.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_aa^r=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>8. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b9767f6138fe2bfec13de54549806b3492fea03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_ax^r=r\\log_ax$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>9. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e730eb021b5efe4889bcc1fbc377dd2a631264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_ax=\\frac{\\log_bx}{\\log_ba}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"119\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>10. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f7512ab62f410558c8c092a1ccd2bcadb1a3ffa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_ab=\\frac{1}{\\log_ba}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"115\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm_Properties&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 301/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2086/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.467      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.467      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34956:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018093559 and revision id 279338. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}